  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "The length of the chain needed to wrap around the tree is its circumference.\n\nThe formula for the circumference of a circle is $C=\\pi d,$ where $d=2\\,\\text{yd}$ is the diameter.\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nC=\\pi \\cdot 2=2\\pi \\,\\text{yd}.\n$$",
